comment.narrative:
The expected results of the project were achieved by December 31, 2024. 
Six (06) advocacy initiatives were carried out at the national level by Benkadi. These are: 
-    two (02) pleas made at COP16 in Cali https://www.facebook.com/share/p/1XF3y6aSgy/ and COP 29 in Baku https://www.facebook.com/share/p/19w3NacFrz/ for the mobilization of funding to ensure the sustainability of Benkadi's achievements; 
•    advocacy directed at the Parliament (ALT) and the ministry responsible for the environment for the adoption of the law on plastic bags and packaging; https://www.facebook.com/share/p/15eeo3UyKP/ 
-    advocacy with the private sector (Coris Bank International) for the mobilization of climate finance for the benefit of CSOs;
-    advocacy at the CNACC session for the mobilization of funding and better involvement of CSOs;
-    finally, advocacy with the ministry in charge of the environment (SP/CNDD) for a more ambitious NDC in collaboration with OXFAM
